# Live text in a document in another script (here marked Greek) whose models the phone
# does not have: a quiet offer to download them over the pages. "Download" fetches them
# (run.sh points PAGEBARA_OCR_FETCH_DIR at a folder instead of the network) and the pictures
# are read again with them. Needs $PAGEBARA_OCR_MODELS.
open "$SAMPLES/live-text-greek.pdf"
wait 800
assert live.available == true
assert offer.state == none
# A long press on the screenshot: read as Latin meanwhile, and the offer.
drag page 1 100,251 page 1 100,251 1000
await offer.state == offered 5000
assert offer contains Greek
await live.words:1 >= 10 20000
screenshot 08-offer.png
click "Download" 200
await message contains ready 30000
assert offer.state == none
assert offer == ""
assert file.exists:$OUT/profile/ocr-models/ppocrv5-greek-rec.onnx == true
# Read again with the Greek models: nothing recognised is kept from before.
assert live.words:1 == 0
drag page 1 100,251 page 1 100,251 1000
await live.words:1 >= 5 20000
assert dirty == false
